{{#> base}}
    <h2>IFCA Event Reminder</h2>
    <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
    
    <p>This is a friendly reminder about your upcoming IFCA event:</p>
    
    <div class="alert alert-info">
        <h3>Event Details</h3>
        <p><strong>Event:</strong> {{eventName}}<br>
        <strong>Date:</strong> {{eventDate}}<br>
        <strong>Time:</strong> {{eventTime}}<br>
        <strong>Venue:</strong> {{eventVenue}}<br>
        <strong>Registration ID:</strong> {{registrationId}}</p>
    </div>

    <p>We look forward to your participation! You can view the event details and add it to your calendar using the button below:</p>
    
    <a href="{{eventUrl}}" class="button">View Event Details</a>

    <div class="metadata">
        <p><strong>Pre-Event Checklist:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>✓ Confirm your attendance</li>
            <li>✓ Prepare your IFCA membership card and photo ID</li>
            <li>✓ Plan your route to the venue</li>
            <li>✓ Review the event schedule and requirements</li>
            <li>✓ Check if you need to bring any specific equipment or materials</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <p>For any last-minute queries or assistance, please contact our events team:</p>
    <p>Email: events@ifcaindia.com<br>
    Phone: +91 00000 00000</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>
    The IFCA Events Team</p>
{{/base}} 